{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36982","headline":"淮南送节度卢端公将命之汴州端公常爲汴州相公从事 · 罗隐","name":"淮南送节度卢端公将命之汴州端公常爲汴州相公从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吹台高倚圃田东，此去轺车事不同。\n珠履旧参萧相国，彩衣今佐晋司空。\n醉离淮甸寒星下，吟指梁园密雪中。\n到彼的知宣室语，几时徵拜黑头公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36982.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36982","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}